{"seq":12,"slug":"uikit-in-depth","title":"UIKit 深入实践","stage":"DONE","category":"mobile","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/mobile/uikit-in-depth","rating":{"composite":3.53,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# UIKit 深入实践 简介\n\nSwiftUI 是 iOS 的未来，但 UIKit 仍是绝大多数遗留代码与混合代码库的基础——会用 UIKit 是 iOS 工程师的必备。本 hub 面向需要维护或编写 UIKit 代码（尤其 Objective-C 遗留 + SwiftUI 双轨）的 iOS 工程师，从 Auto Layout（约束基础、Stack View、代码 vs IB）讲起，覆盖视图控制器（生命周期、容器与子控制器、导航与呈现）、列表与集合（UITableView 基础、Diffable Data Source、Compositional Layout），以及交互与绘制（响应链与手势、自定义绘制与 CALayer、内存管理与循环引用）。它填补 `04_mobile` 此前只有 SwiftUI、缺 UIKit 的空白。贯穿全篇的工程要点是：用约束/Stack View 做自适应布局、把逻辑放对生命周期方法、用容器对抗巨型控制器、用 diffable + compositional 现代化列表、用手势处理交互、并用 `[weak self]` 避免循环引用泄漏。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"auto-layout","title":"Auto Layout","docCount":3,"url":"/h/mobile/uikit-in-depth/auto-layout","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"constraints-fundamentals","title":"约束基础","url":"/h/mobile/uikit-in-depth/auto-layout/constraints-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"stack-views","title":"Stack View 堆栈视图","url":"/h/mobile/uikit-in-depth/auto-layout/stack-views"},{"seq":3,"slug":"programmatic-vs-ib","title":"代码布局与 Interface Builder","url":"/h/mobile/uikit-in-depth/auto-layout/programmatic-vs-ib"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"view-controllers","title":"View Controllers","docCount":3,"url":"/h/mobile/uikit-in-depth/view-controllers","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"lifecycle","title":"视图控制器生命周期","url":"/h/mobile/uikit-in-depth/view-controllers/lifecycle"},{"seq":2,"slug":"container-and-containment","title":"容器与子控制器","url":"/h/mobile/uikit-in-depth/view-controllers/container-and-containment"},{"seq":3,"slug":"navigation-and-presentation","title":"导航与呈现","url":"/h/mobile/uikit-in-depth/view-controllers/navigation-and-presentation"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"lists-and-collections","title":"Lists And Collections","docCount":3,"ur